6. Python runtime dependencies
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Two virtual environments ship (Doc 28 §5): the worker's project venv and the isolated ComfyUI venv.
Every wheel installed in them carries its own licence text in its `*.dist-info` directory under
`Lib/site-packages/`. **The installer must ship those `dist-info` directories** — that is where the
per-package licence texts live, and copying only the importable packages would strip them.

